#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:5
#: 8596646b962a4b9c9cd405cf0bb13100
msgid "Autonomous Autorotation"
msgstr "自主自转"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:7
#: 618c9fc5773249e18fd2d228efa74e9f
msgid ""
"This page introduces the helicopter autorotation flight mode.  To assist in "
"understanding how the mode works a basic overview of the theory is first "
"given.  This will be followed by instructions on how to setup and tune the "
"flight mode.  However, as this mode is still in development, a link to the "
"forum thread is provided.  This thread contains all the latest information "
"on the mode, as it is created."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍直升机自转飞行模式。为帮助理解该模式的工作原理，首先给出基本理论概述，随后提供设置和调参该飞行模式的说明。由于该模式仍在开发中，提供了论坛帖子的链接，该帖子包含该模式的所有最新信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:14
#: c570ab90300b4f359e98e8a47fa7be9b
msgid ""
"This flight mode is available for traditional helicopters only.  It is "
"currently limited to single rotor helicopters."
msgstr "此飞行模式仅适用于传统直升机，目前仅限于单旋翼直升机。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:18
#: 7e8053c9815d492eb79316c47ba80c9b
msgid ""
"This is an ongoing development project.  This is only enabled for use with "
"SITL.  Do not attempt to use this flight mode in real life."
msgstr "这是一个持续开发的项目，目前仅支持在 SITL 中启用。请勿在实际飞行中尝试使用此飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:23
#: 4651b446eef643f89ce8a77af556995b
msgid "Overview of the Autorotation Manoeuvre"
msgstr "自转机动概述"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:25
#: 65675a1259a64b07807a6d95b269ad2b
msgid ""
"Traditional helicopters are capable of landing safely after losing "
"propulsive power.  This is achieved through the autorotation manoeuvre, in "
"which the descending aircraft can use the airflow being forced up through "
"the main blades to drive the rotor and still produce some upwards thrust.  "
"The primary goal of the manoeuvre is to use the aircraft's remaining energy "
"to bring the aircraft safely to the ground, landing softly."
msgstr ""
"传统直升机在失去推进动力后能够安全降落。这是通过自转（autorotation）机动实现的：下降中的直升机可以利用被迫向上穿过主桨叶的气流来驱动旋翼，从而仍能产生一定的向上推力。该机动的主要目标是利用飞行器的剩余能量使其安全到达地面，实现平稳着陆。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:30
#: ced45a722bf4412698d971517b195197
msgid ""
"The manoeuvre can be broken down into phases.  The breakdown and description"
" of those phases differs across the literature that is available on the "
"topic.  The description that is given here matches the approach taken in the"
" implementation with ArduCopter."
msgstr "该机动可以分为几个阶段。该主题现有文献对各阶段的划分和描述不尽相同，这里给出的描述与 ArduCopter 实现中所采用的方法相对应。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:33
#: c73fbb93803c4e8a8eaadc8c261361f2
msgid "There are four phases of the autorotation:"
msgstr "自转的四个阶段："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:35
#: c07c2f871bfc432cab82896c9b4be265
msgid ""
"**1. Entry** - The initial actions of the vehicle in which collective is "
"used to minimize head speed loss and cyclic is used for attitude control to "
"either maintain or begin building forward airspeed."
msgstr "**1. 进入阶段** - 飞行器的初始动作，使用总距最小化旋翼转速损失，使用周期变距控制姿态以维持或开始建立前飞速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:38
#: 36ecf7336be243c2a8aaeb08de8425a9
msgid ""
"**2. Glide** - The continuation of the entry phase in which collective is "
"used to manage head speed and cyclic is used to manage airspeed. In this "
"phase the aircraft can be gently navigated to attain the most suitable "
"landing area, within its gliding range."
msgstr ""
"**2. 滑翔阶段** - 进入阶段的延续，使用总距管理旋翼转速，使用周期变距管理空速。在此阶段，飞机可以缓慢导航至最合适的降落区域（在其滑翔范围内）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:41
#: 75329cd9b2c24d3fbd33a18e56df15f8
msgid ""
"**3. Flare** - Performed close to the ground this phase of the manoeuvre "
"looks to convert airspeed into lift, reducing descent speed and, where "
"necessary, building head speed.  This is achieved through a complex coupling"
" of both collective and cyclic."
msgstr ""
"**3. 拉飘阶段** - "
"在接近地面时执行，该阶段旨在将前飞速度转化为升力，降低下降速度，并在必要时提升旋翼转速。这通过总距和周期变距的复杂耦合配合来实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:44
#: db09bee05a8b499f9fd449244900bbf6
msgid ""
"**4. Touch-Down** - The vehicle is gently landed using the energy remaining "
"in the rotor head.  Head speed is converted into thrust through collective "
"management and cyclic is used to maintain a landing attitude."
msgstr "**4. 接地阶段** - 利用旋翼中剩余的能量轻柔地将飞机降落。通过总距控制将旋翼转速转化为推力，用周期变距维持降落姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:47
#: ce1563218ba64ced97dc08a5998bace8
msgid ""
"The diagram below illustrates the four phases.  Each phase will now be "
"explained in more detail."
msgstr "下图说明了这四个阶段，接下来将对每个阶段进行更详细的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:54
#: 2af1337f2b5e493694f467eaa4813fa7
msgid "Entry Phase"
msgstr "进入阶段"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:56
#: 431993b18726443b9f887c2faee11ac0
msgid ""
"Without sufficient power to maintain flight a helicopter will descend.  The "
"descending aircraft can utilise the relative upward flowing air to drive the"
" main rotor.  This is the essence of the autorotation.  This is illustrated "
"in the image below, in which the left-hand images show a simplified view of "
"how the rotor forces are generated in normal powered flight.  This can then "
"be compared with the images on the right which show the forces generated "
"whilst gliding in an autorotation."
msgstr ""
"在没有足够动力维持飞行的情况下，直升机将下降。下降的飞机可以利用相对向上流动的空气来驱动主旋翼，这就是自转的本质。下图中，左侧图片显示了正常动力飞行中旋翼力是如何产生的简化视图，可以与右侧图片对比，右侧展示了在自转滑翔中产生的力。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:63
#: 45d65acf0669469fba4268cf8300bb81
msgid ""
"A key difference to note between the two scenarios is the reversal of the "
"vertical velocity component.  It is this reversal of the vertical velocity "
"that necessitates careful collective management when entering the "
"autorotation.  The objective is to reduce the blade collective angle "
"reducing the risk of blade stall.  It is key that the collective is moved "
"proportionally to the direction of the resultant velocity vector to minimize"
" the blade drag generated, preventing excessive loss of head speed.  As the "
"descent velocity increases the lift vector will naturally rotate towards the"
" leading edge of the blade, providing the driving force to maintain rotor "
"RPM."
msgstr ""
"两种情况之间需要注意的一个关键区别是垂直速度分量的反向。正是这种垂直速度的反向，使得进入自转时需要仔细管理总距。目标是减小桨叶总距角，降低桨叶失速的风险。关键是总距的调整应与合速度矢量的方向成比例，以最小化桨叶产生的阻力，防止旋翼转速过度损失。随着下降速度增加，升力矢量将自然地向桨叶前缘旋转，提供维持旋翼转速的驱动力。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:69
#: 3dd3b407771a404a9109df84428a64f5
msgid ""
"In addition to this, the forward airspeed must be either maintained or "
"increased (if the failure is initiated from a low airspeed state).  This is "
"done through cyclic controls."
msgstr "此外，前飞速度必须维持或提高（如果失效是从低速状态开始的）。这通过周期变距控制来实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:74
#: 4c58178e6eed49118273a264970d6a12
msgid "Glide Phase"
msgstr "滑翔阶段"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:76
#: 15bbbe0647404c6c8812d7c12f2287b5
msgid ""
"This phase of the manoeuvre is analogous to gliding flight for fixed-wing "
"aircraft.  Forward airspeed is necessary for efficient flight and will "
"improve the range of the helicopter, increasing the likelihood of finding a "
"suitable landing area.  It is important to maintain aircraft energy as "
"efficiently as possible in the glide phase so that the maximum amount of "
"energy is available for the flare and touch-down phase."
msgstr ""
"该机动的这个阶段类似于固定翼飞机的滑翔飞行。前飞速度对于高效飞行是必要的，可以提高直升机的航程，增加找到合适降落区域的可能性。在滑翔阶段，尽可能高效地保持飞机能量非常重要，以确保拉飘和接地阶段有最大的可用能量。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:80
#: 3a751f974a1b4100984ca1cb63eeccfc
msgid ""
"It is during this phase of flight that small angles of bank and low yaw "
"rates can be applied to navigate the aircraft towards a suitable landing "
"area, and where possible, turn to land into wind."
msgstr "在飞行的这个阶段，可以施加小角度的横滚和低偏航速率，将飞机引导至合适的降落区域，并在可能的情况下转向逆风降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:85
#: b0a1e05f6b12448abd11c97e0b884f82
msgid "Flare Phase"
msgstr "拉飘阶段"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:87
#: b4d941cd70f241eeb9283c400caa0597
msgid ""
"This is the most critical phase for achieving a good landing during "
"autorotation.  The objectives here are to:"
msgstr "这是自转中实现良好降落最关键的阶段。此阶段的目标是："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:89
#: 5c15c58bc94e410dad031f965e78a30f
msgid "Reduce vertical descent speed."
msgstr "降低垂直下降速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:90
#: 9f91291b65df4d42a9b6b66cb89d6522
msgid "Convert forward airspeed into main rotor lift."
msgstr "将前飞速度转化为主旋翼升力。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:91
#: 76597360cf9b428f9cb6520bb8ab5f90
msgid ""
"Perform the manoeuvre close to the ground so as to minimize the height loss "
"required during the touch-down phase."
msgstr "在接近地面处执行机动，以最小化接地阶段所需的高度损失。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:93
#: 5e413529bb524113b967dfc05865a3cf
msgid ""
"Cyclic is used to pitch the aircraft nose up.  Doing so changes the "
"effective angle of attack seen by the main rotor blades.  This has the "
"effects of both increasing the lift force and rotating the lift vector "
"towards the leading edge of the blade.  Hence, a greater component of the "
"blade lift is available for driving the main rotor, providing more energy "
"for use in the touch-down phase.  In addition, the larger lift and drag "
"forces generated in the flare contribute to the deceleration of the aircraft"
" ready for landing.  Collective is subsequently used to manage the head "
"speed, preventing overspeed and blade stall as required.  It is during this "
"phase of flight, toward the transition to touch-down, that the flow "
"direction is once again reversed and the rotor begins generating a downward "
"induced flow once more."
msgstr ""
"使用周期变距将飞机机头拉高，这改变了主旋翼桨叶所感受到的有效迎角。这具有增大升力和将升力矢量向桨叶前缘旋转的双重效果。因此，更大比例的桨叶升力可用于驱动主旋翼，为接地阶段提供更多能量。此外，拉飘产生的较大升力和阻力有助于飞机减速，为降落做准备。随后使用总距管理旋翼转速，防止超速和桨叶失速。在飞行的这个阶段，向过渡到接地阶段时，气流方向再次反向，旋翼再次开始产生向下的诱导气流。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:100
#: 26bd59489cb849aebc5f5988ce03236d
msgid ""
"As this manoeuvre is flown close to the ground it requires a reliable height"
" estimate that can account for the local terrain.  Downward facing LiDaR is "
"therefore highly recommended."
msgstr "由于该机动在接近地面处飞行，需要可靠的高度估计，且能够反映当地地形。因此强烈建议使用朝下的激光雷达。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:105
#: 9f22a2c56c2842449f14d9f489cee8c8
msgid "Touch-Down Phase"
msgstr "接地阶段"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:107
#: f9b4c0aac2764528a9512e60cd9a0e8d
msgid ""
"Finally, with the aircraft now close to the ground, with low forward and "
"descent speeds, it can be gently lowered to the ground.  This is achieved "
"using the energy remaining in the main rotor to produce/maintain an induced "
"flow.  As energy in the main rotor is used it will slow, meaning more and "
"more positive collective is applied to maintain the thrust force being "
"generated.  The aircraft must therefore be landed before the head speed "
"slows too much, resulting in blade stall.  This phase of the autorotation is"
" highly dependent on the amount of energy that can be stored in the main "
"rotor head.  Main rotors with higher inertia are therefore comparatively "
"easier to autorotate due to their greater capacity to store energy.  This is"
" one reason why larger RC helicopters are deemed easier to autorotate than "
"their smaller counterparts."
msgstr ""
"最后，飞机现已接近地面，前飞和下降速度均较低，可以轻柔地降至地面。这通过使用主旋翼中剩余的能量来产生/维持诱导气流来实现。随着主旋翼中能量的消耗，旋翼会减慢，这意味着需要施加越来越多的正总距以维持产生的推力。因此，飞机必须在旋翼转速降得太低（导致桨叶失速）之前完成降落。自转的这个阶段高度依赖于主旋翼中可以储存的能量总量。具有更高惯量的主旋翼自转相对更容易，因为其储存能量的能力更强。这就是为什么较大的"
" RC 直升机被认为比其小型对应物更容易执行自转的原因之一。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:116
#: dc2e1db4752c486d86176e8b71e32468
msgid "Bail-Out Phase"
msgstr "紧急退出阶段"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:118
#: 1d5878ed763c41bc93194822cfe35e7a
msgid ""
"Not a part of the \"standard\" autorotation, the bail-out phase has been "
"created for the purposes of recovering the aircraft when tuning the flight "
"mode or for when power is restored after a temporary power failure clears "
"(e.g. a kinked fuel line becomes straight again).  When exiting the "
"autonomous autorotation flight mode the aircraft will be returned to a "
"\"non-manual collective mode\".  It is therefore necessary to gently "
"reintroduce the z position controller to prevent aggressive collective "
"angles being applied, resulting in blade stall or even rotor stop."
msgstr ""
"紧急退出阶段不属于\"标准\"自转的一部分，其目的是在调参飞行模式时或临时动力故障恢复后（例如，扭折的燃油管重新变直）恢复飞机。退出自主自转飞行模式时，飞机将返回\"非手动总距模式\"。因此，有必要缓慢重新引入"
" Z 轴位置控制器，以防止施加激进的总距角，导致桨叶失速甚至旋翼停转。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:123
#: f5b85dbca40f4e20b124028a65b90d31
msgid ""
"When initiated, the bail-out phase will read the requested climb or descent "
"rate from the operators throttle stick position.  The aircraft will then be "
"decelerated over a set period of time (see parameter AROT_BAIL_TIME).  At "
"the end of which, the requested vertical speed will match the magnitude "
"requested on the stick. The time spent in this phase is typically of the "
"order of two seconds.  Smaller helicopters (550 size and below) may require "
"this time to be extended to three or four seconds.  When deciding/tuning, it"
" is conservative to opt for a longer time and initiate a practice bail-out "
"with a large height margin for recovery."
msgstr ""
"启动后，紧急退出阶段将读取操纵手油门摇杆位置所请求的爬升或下降速率。飞机随后将在设定的时间段内（见参数 "
"AROT_BAIL_TIME）减速，结束时所请求的垂直速度将与摇杆所请求的幅值相匹配。在此阶段花费的时间通常约为两秒。较小的直升机（550 "
"级及以下）可能需要将此时间延长至三到四秒。在决定/调参时，保守地选择较长的时间，并在有较大高度余量的情况下进行练习紧急退出。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:130
#: 158398b8f0e84904b6c80cdb5b256eb7
msgid ""
"The motor ramp time defined by H_RSC_RAMP_TIME is ignored during bail-out, "
"and a hard-coded ramp time of one second is used."
msgstr "H_RSC_RAMP_TIME 定义的电机斜坡时间在紧急退出期间被忽略，使用硬编码的一秒斜坡时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:135
#: e7182f946b0443ee8b8be42e6a13f506
msgid ""
"The ramp time defined by H_RSC_RAMP_TIME is now only observed when the "
"aircraft is on ground and the \"landed flag\" is set true.  It often takes "
"ArduCopter a second to register that the aircraft has landed once on the "
"ground.  Therefore, if the interlock is re-engaged immediately after the "
"aircraft touches down the one second ramp time of the bail-out phase can be "
"initiated on the ground.  Caution is therefore required when running "
"autorotations in quick succession to prevent rapid rotor spool up on ground."
msgstr ""
"H_RSC_RAMP_TIME 定义的斜坡时间现在仅在飞机在地面且\"已降落标志\"为真时才被遵守。ArduCopter "
"通常需要一秒钟才能在飞机接地后识别已降落。因此，如果飞机接地后立即重新接合联锁装置，紧急退出阶段的一秒斜坡时间可能在地面上启动。因此，在快速连续执行自转时，需要谨慎防止旋翼在地面上快速加速。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:142
#: ad3f126e028c4e3bac832903353ec2ef
msgid "Mode Setup"
msgstr "模式设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:144
#: b00d713ec7204056b0d02bbad08ba0f2
msgid ""
"This flight mode is currently under development.  It is available in Copter "
"4.0 as SITL only, for those that want to test the entry, glide, and bail-out"
" phases. For the most up-to-date information please see this `Discourse "
"Topic <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/autonomous-autorotation-gsoc-project-"
"blog/42139>`__ . Once the mode has been sufficiently tested the final "
"instructions will be published and maintained on this wiki page."
msgstr ""
"此飞行模式目前正在开发中。在 Copter 4.0 中仅作为 SITL 提供，供希望测试进入、滑翔和紧急退出阶段的用户使用。最新信息请参阅此 "
"`Discourse 主题 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/autonomous-autorotation-gsoc-"
"project-blog/42139>`__。一旦该模式经过充分测试，最终说明将在本 Wiki 页面上发布和维护。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:151
#: 22a1df7a1dbc4336a4f70976546f4b34
msgid "Mode Entry"
msgstr "模式进入"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode.rst:153
#: 93925690f29447bc9e429ef5812929eb
msgid ""
"The autonomous autorotation flight mode cannot be entered via a mode switch,"
" as is done with other flight modes.  In an attempt to mimic the "
"autorotation procedure followed when flying a manual autorotation, the mode "
"is entered and exited using the motor interlock switch.  The autonomous "
"flight mode can only be entered if the interlock is disengaged whilst flying"
" in a non-manual collective mode.  When exiting the autorotation the flight "
"mode is returned to the mode from which it came (e.g. Altitude Hold -> "
"Autonomous Autorotation -> Altitude Hold).  The only exception to this is "
"when the aircraft enters the autorotation from an auto mission. In which "
"case, the mode is exited into Altitude Hold.  This is done to prevent the "
"aircraft from potentially resuming its auto mission and flying further away "
"from home, whereby in the scenario it has autonomously recovered from a "
"power failure and is therefore high risk for another power failure."
msgstr ""
"自主自转飞行模式不能通过飞行模式切换开关进入，与其他飞行模式不同。为了模拟手动自转时遵循的自转程序，该模式通过电机联锁开关进入和退出。自主飞行模式只能在非手动总距模式下飞行时，联锁解除的情况下才能进入。退出自转时，飞行模式返回到进入前的模式（例如：AltHold"
" -> 自主自转 -> AltHold）。唯一的例外是飞行器从自动任务进入自转时，此时模式退出后切换到 "
"AltHold。这样做是为了防止飞行器可能恢复自动任务并飞离 Home 更远，因为在这种情况下它已自主从断电故障中恢复，因此再次断电的风险很高。"

